{"Blacklist emails are lowercased but guest input is not normalized, allowing blacklisted addresses with different casing (e.g., Foo@bar.com vs foo@bar.com) to bypass the filter": 0.9601747393608093, "isTeamAdminOrOwner check uses && instead of ||, requiring user to be both team admin and team owner (usually exclusive roles), making the team-based permission path unusable": 0.9515655636787415, "sendAddGuestsEmails is passed the raw guests input instead of the filtered uniqueGuests list, causing re-entered existing emails to be treated as new and bypassing blacklist filtering for email logic": 0.9592827558517456, "Zod email-array validation in AddGuestsDialog duplicates server-side validation in addGuests.schema.ts, risking drift between client and server rules for uniqueness checks and error messaging": 0.2899666726589203}